      "literal": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_0(i) &= q_{4i-3} \\\\\nf_1(i) &= q_{4i-2} \\\\\nf_2(i) &= q_{4i-1} \\\\\nf_3(i) &= q_{4i}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
