      "literal": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nd(i,j) &= \\sum\\limits_{a}{||\\Delta n_a(i,j)||^2} \\\\\n &= (\\Delta n_0(i,j))^2 + (\\Delta n_1(i,j))^2 + (\\Delta n_2(i,j))^2 + (\\Delta n_3(i,j))^2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
